Package: panelcointr
Title: Panel Cointegration Tests
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("G. Nono", "Ghislain", , "nonoghislain@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements panel cointegration tests robust to cross-section
    dependence and structural breaks, including the error-correction tests
    of Westerlund (2007), the Durbin-Hausman tests of Westerlund (2008),
    and the tests of Banerjee and Carrion-i-Silvestre (2015, 2017).
